                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We offer a wide range of styles, including curved, mixed-shape, eternity, stackable, plain, nature-inspired, and gemstone bands. Each style matches different aesthetic preferences, ensuring you find the perfect band to symbolize your unique love story. It’s time to elevate your bridal elegance with Wedding Day Diamond!</p>",
