                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jDbKL3": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, our collection includes wedding bands featuring various gemstones such as sapphires, rubies, and emeralds. These bands offer a vibrant and captivating alternative to traditional diamond rings, allowing for a personalized touch that reflects your style and adds a pop of color.</p>",
