                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_mmN79y": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, we feature nature-inspired bands with designs like leaves, vines, and floral patterns. These rings are perfect for those who love nature or seek a unique, organic aesthetic. They add a touch of natural beauty and elegance to your wedding jewelry.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
